        // Create a new Document with a root element
        Element root = new Element("html", null);

        // Create a new TextNode
        TextNode textNode = new TextNode("<p>This is a paragraph of text.</p>");

        // Add the text node to the document
        Document doc = new Document(root);
        doc.addTextNode(textNode);

        // Print the HTML representation of the document
        System.out.println(doc.getRootElement().toString());
    }
}
```

This will output:

```html
<html><body><p>This is a paragraph of text.</p></body></html>
